---
title: CareBridge - About page
layout: base.njk
---

<section class="container" style="padding: 3rem 0;">
  <h1 style="text-align: center;">Our Mission: Healthcare Without Borders</h1>
  <p style="text-align: center; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.2rem;">
    CareBridge was founded during a global hackathon with one simple goal: 
    <strong>To ensure that no one dies because they couldn't afford a pill.</strong>
  </p>

  <hr style="margin: 4rem 0;">

  <div class="grid">
    <div>
      <h2>The Problem</h2>
      <p>Every year, millions of people face "Catastrophic Health Expenditure." When a medical crisis hits, families are forced to choose between food and medicine. Traditional crowdfunding is slow, filled with scams, and often violates patient privacy.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2>The CareBridge Solution</h2>
      <p>We built a direct-impact bridge. By removing middlemen and focusing on <strong>verified medical bills</strong> rather than personal stories, we create a transparent ecosystem where donors know exactly which medicine they are buying and for whom.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section style="margin-top: 4rem;">
    <h3>Our Core Values</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Privacy:</strong> We never share patient faces or names. Dignity is a human right.</li>
      <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> Donors see real stamps and real costs before they spend a cent.</li>
      <li><strong>Urgency:</strong> Our platform is optimized for mobile so requests can be made from a hospital bed or a pharmacy line.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <article class="home-impact-section" style="padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-top: 4rem;">
    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <h4 style="color: white">UNSDG Alignment</h4>
        <p style="color: white">CareBridge is a proud supporter of <strong>United Nations Sustainable Development Goal #3: Good Health and Well-Being.</strong> We are committed to achieving universal health coverage and access to safe, effective, and affordable essential medicines for all.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
         <img src="/icons/unsdg3.png" alt="SDG 3 Icon" style="width: 150px;">
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <section class="container" style="margin-top: 5rem; text-align: center;">
    <h2>Meet the Team</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      {% for member in team.members %}
      <article>
        <header>
          <h3>{{ member.name }}</h3>
        </header>
        
        <p>
          <small>
            {{ member.role }}
          </small>
        </p>
        
        <footer>
          <a href="{{ member.github }}">GitHub</a>
        </footer>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    
    <p><i>Thanks to <a href="https://github.com/developerDhanjit" target="_blank">Dhanjit Nath</a> for technical guidance on stack selection and database choices.</i></p>
  </section>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 4rem;">
    <a href="/requests" role="button">Start Making an Impact</a>
  </div>
</section>
